   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">OLYMPIA, GREECE - MARCH 24:  A general view of the ancient ruins in Olympia, Greece on March 24, 2004 where the Olympic Flame is lit from the sun before each Olympic games competition. (Photo by Todd Warshaw/Getty Images)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
